            Three finetuning datasets yield five evaluation variants:{" "}
            <strong>plug insertion</strong> (~150 demonstrations),{" "}
            <strong>tumbler stacking and unstacking</strong> (~100), and{" "}
            <strong>test-tube racking and unracking</strong> (~300). Rho-FR3-Duo
